"}, "D6S8": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d05", "start": 496, "end": 572, "text": "Guitarist John Tropea and flautist Hubert Laws appeared on his early albums."}, "D6S9": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d05", "start": 573, "end": 602, "text": "\"Prelude\", his first album in"}, "D7S1": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d06", "start": 0, "end": 100, "text": "9 ] Career [ edit ] Recording career [ edit ] Deodato often plays the Fender Rhodes electric piano ."}, "D7S2": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d06", "start": 101, "end": 157, "text": "He became successful as a keyboard player in the 1970s ."}, "D7S3": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d06", "start": 158, "end": 330, "text": "Since then , he has produced and arranged music on more than 500 albums for artists such as Kool & the Gang , Con Funk Shun , Björk , Christophe , Ithamara Koorax and k.d ."}, "D7S4": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d06", "start": 331, "end": 337, "text": "lang ."}, "D7S5": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d06", "start": 338, "end": 415, "text": "Guitarist John Tropea and flautist Hubert Laws appeared on his early albums ."}, "D7S6": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d06", "start": 416, "end": 453, "text": "Prelude , his first album in the U.S."}, "D7S7": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d06", "start": 454, "end": 478, "text": ", was released in 1973 ."}, "D7S8": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d06", "start": 479, "end": 489, "text": "[ 10 ] His"}, "D8S1": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d07", "start": 0, "end": 49, "text": ", but you got to understand where it comes from ."}, "D8S2": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d07", "start": 50, "end": 144, "text": "The more you understand about that , the better youâre going to get at what youâre doing ."}, "D8S3": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d07", "start": 145, "end": 211, "text": "Because then you can see that there are basically no limitations ."}, "D8S4": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d07", "start": 212, "end": 266, "text": "At a time when there used to be a lot of limitations ."}, "D8S5": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d07", "start": 267, "end": 388, "text": "You couldnât do just anything you want and take a piece of a song , put it here instantly , there was no such a thing ."}, "D8S6": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d07", "start": 389, "end": 460, "text": "I produced a record by Chuck Mangione where every solo was a disaster ."}, "D8S7": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d07", "start": 461, "end": 476, "text": "I had to go and"}, "D9S1": {"document_number": 9, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d08", "start": 0, "end": 607, "text": "Eumir Deodato - Wikiwand English Sign in Top Qs Timeline Chat Perspective AI tools Top Qs Timeline Chat Perspective All Articles Dictionary Quotes Map Eumir Deodato Brazilian pianist , composer , arranger and producer ( born 1943 ) From Wikipedia , the free encyclopedia Eumir Deodato Biography Career Recording career Arranging and producing Personal life Discography Albums As sideman Singles References External links Eumir Deodato de Almeida ( Brazilian Portuguese : [ ẽwˈmiʁ deoˈdatu ] ; born 22 June 1943 ) [ 3 ] is a Brazilian pianist , composer , arranger and record producer , primarily in jazz but"}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Messina, Sicily", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d00:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Florence, Italy", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0446-f7e7a6265c4e:d01:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C2", "answer": "Lucca and Pisa", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0446-f7e7